{"answer":"Phenotype **12595**:\n\n- **Name:** Skin Cancer (Phecode)\n- **UQID:** `5928820ddb5d4bbe8e387369bff8da22`\n- **Phenotype category:** General\n- **Version:** 1.1\n- **Created:** 2023-10-30T20:58:25.061+00:00\n- **Last modified:** 2025-05-13T12:09:19.414+00:00\n\n**Description:**\nDefined using the \"Phecode\" grouping created by J Denny and colleagues. Phecodes map ICD-9 and ICD-10 codes to clinically relevant phenotypes and were created through manual review. The mapping provided here is for Phecode versions \"Phecode Map 1.2 with ICD-9 Codes\" and \"Phecode Map 1.2 with ICD-10cm Codes (beta)\". \"Exclude range of phecodes\" were not applied.\n\n**Algorithm information:**\n- **Algorithm ID:** 8138\n- **Algorithm description:** Patients with at least one ICD-9 or ICD-10 code are considered a case for the phenotype.\n- **Population:** eMERGE participants\n- **Validated:** false\n\n**Source:**\n- eMERGE\n\n**Keyword:**\n- Phe_172\n\n**Publication:**\n- *Systematic comparison of phenome-wide association study of electronic medical record data and genome-wide association study data*  \n  https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24270849/\n\nIf you want, I can also list the associated ICD code ranges from the returned data.","action":{"action":"get_phenotype","query":null,"id":"12595","base_id":null,"compare_ids":null,"enum_type":null,"is_validated":null,"has_algorithm_code":null,"has_publication":null,"has_attachment":null,"limit":null},"structured":null,"cipher_data":{"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"id":12595,"fullName":"Skin Cancer (Phecode)","created":"2023-10-30T20:58:25.061+00:00","lastModified":"2025-05-13T12:09:19.414+00:00","lastModifiedBy":104,"createdBy":223,"revision":2,"phenotypeStatusId":null,"vaDeveloped":false,"categoryTypeId":61,"uqid":"5928820ddb5d4bbe8e387369bff8da22","description":"Phenotype defined using the \"Phecode\" grouping created by J Denny and colleagues. Phecodes map ICD-9 and ICD-10 codes to clinically relevant phenotypes and were creat